Mori L'Arabi has said, Shalom.

cue0090435
01:19:17.640 --> 01:19:18.640
Shalom.

cue0090436
01:19:18.640 --> 01:19:19.640
Hang on and on.

cue0090437
01:19:19.640 --> 01:19:20.640
Hang on and on.

cue0090438
01:19:20.640 --> 01:19:21.640
In Kohelet.

cue0090439
01:19:21.640 --> 01:19:22.640
In Kohelet.

